AssetPort-CN
============

This project includes and modifies software from Asset-Port:

  Upstream project: https://github.com/Colosyn/Asset-Port
  Original author: Colosyn (Shahnawaz Hussain)
  Original license: MIT License

The original copyright notice and MIT License are preserved in LICENSE.
AssetPort-CN is an unofficial community modification and is not affiliated
with or endorsed by the original author.

AssetPort-CN modifications include bilingual Chinese/English UI support,
automatic material fallback generation, texture compression rules, and
compatibility with common prefixless marketplace asset names.

